side County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, May to June and September to October each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 43% of normal in August to September and 43% in September to October. Grid 25960 had its driest year in 2005 at 58%.</p>"}
